    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n12304" root="دخن" body-key="d">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِدْخَنَةٌ</span></b>  <i>A vessel for fumigation; i. q.</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِجْمَرَةٌ</span>:
(K:) or <i>differing from the</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِجْمَرَة</span>, [app. in being
<i>made only of baked clay,</i>] and not disapproved;
whereas the <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مجمرة</span> is disapproved, because generally of silver: (Mgh in art <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جمر</span>:) pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَدَاخِنُ</span>.
(TA.)

